      "imageRatio": "40",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "alt": "STKLS102xA board",
      "text": "<h1>An Arm® Cortex®-A53 development kit based on the LS1012A</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKLS102xA, an evaluation kit built on the TQMLS102xA platform, features an Arm® Cortex®-A53 based on LS1012A. It caters to embedded computing engineers with high-speed communication capabilities through 3x Gigabit Ethernet, 2x PCIe, and 1x USB 3.0 interface, making it ideal for demanding applications. This kit includes IEEE 1588 support and robust security functions, all while maintaining low power consumption (typ. 3 W). Leveraging the QorIQ Trust Architecture and Arm® TrustZone®, it ensures reliable and secure performance for various embedded projects.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 10:50:52 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
